npm dependencies
----------------

Runtime and build dependencies are declared in `package.json` and
`apps/mobile/package.json` and resolved in their `package-lock.json` files;
each carries its own license in its own package. They are not vendored into
this repository. `npm run verify:licenses` checks that every locked package
declares a license compatible with the AGPL (see
`scripts/check-licenses.mjs`).
